  "ruling": "upheld",
  "reason": "The RHP does not contain a disclosed, ordinary explanation for the FY22 PAT spike (2.1x vs FY20-21 average). The financial statements (rhp:p45, rhp:p154) show the spike but the 'Discussion On Results Of Operations' (rhp:p198) only covers the nine-month period ended Dec-22 and does not discuss FY22 vs prior years. The spike appears driven by revenue growth (+46.5%) and a large inventory build-up (change in inventories -₹375L vs -₹58L in FY21), but this is not explained in the narrative.",
  "evidence": ["rhp:p45", "rhp:p154", "rhp:p198"]
